title: Philip_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Philip= "">>
<<setPhase Philip>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Philip == "begin">>
<<jump Philip_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Philip == "comeback">>
<<jump Philip_Comeback01>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Philip_Begin01
---
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "npc">>
Philip: Hi.
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "pc">>
You: Hi!
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "npc">>
Philip: Here's a Maxwell.
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "pc">>
You: Thanks!
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "npc">>
Philip: Don't mention it.
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Philip "comeback">>
===
title: Philip_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "pc">>
You: Not very talkative are you?
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "npc">>
Philip: No.
<<camMove Philip_CamRig "return">>
===